active listening means listening carefully and showing that you understand.

6
00:00:21.894 --> 00:00:24.613
Active listening helps solve problems at work.

7
00:00:25.313 --> 00:00:27.547
Your turn. Say: active listening.

8
00:00:30.247 --> 00:00:31.690
active listening.

9
00:00:32.683 --> 00:00:34.021
misunderstanding.

10
00:00:34.721 --> 00:00:38.810
misunderstanding means a situation where someone does not understand correctly.

11
00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:41.598
The argument started because of a misunderstanding.

12
00:00:42.298 --> 00:00:44.451
Your turn. Say: misunderstanding.

13
00:00:47.151 --> 00:00:48.558
misunderstanding.

14
00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:50.714
body posture.

15
00:00:51.414 --> 00:00:55.004
body posture means the way you hold your body when you sit or stand.

16
00:00:55.304 --> 00:00:57.617
Good body posture makes you look confident.

17
00:00:58.317 --> 00:01:00.632
Your turn. Say: body posture.

18
00:01:03.332 --> 00:01:04.624
body posture.

